# See listings/02-auto-mock/.../org.mockito.plugins.MockMaker for
# the full rationale. Short version: Mockito 5.14.2's bundled Byte
# Buddy doesn't yet support Java 25 class files (major 69), so
# Mockito.mock(...) throws on JDK 25 unless we either select the
# subclass maker (this file) or pass
# -Dnet.bytebuddy.experimental=true to the JVM. Temporary; goes
# away once Mockito ships with a Java-25-aware Byte Buddy.

mock-maker-subclass
